68, 3094&#x2013;3101 (2002).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC123953</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">12039771</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Teira E., Reinthaler T., Pernthaler A., Pernthaler J. &amp; Herndl G. J.
