robiology 3: 37 10.3389/fmicb.2012.00037</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.3389/fmicb.2012.00037</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3274759</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22347878</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Semrau JD, DiSpirito AA, Yoon S (2010) Methanotrophs and copper. FEMS Microbiol Rev 34: 496&#x2013;531 10.1111/j.1574-6976.2010.00212.x</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1111/j.1574-6976.2010.00212.x</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20236329</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Han J-I, Semrau JD (2004) Quantification of gene expression in methanotrophs by competitive reverse transcription-polymerase chain reaction. Environ Microbiol 6: 388&#x2013;399.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">15008816</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>He S, Wurtzel O, Singh K, Froula JL, Yilmaz S, et al. (2010) Validation of two ribosomal RNA removal methods for microbial metatranscriptomics. Nat Meth 7: 807&#x2013;812 10.1038/nmeth.1507</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nmeth.1507</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20852648</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wang J, Krause S, Muyzer G, Meima-Franke M, Laanbroek HJ, et al. (2012) Spatial patterns of iron- and methane-oxidizing bacterial communities in an irregularly flooded, riparian wetland. Frontiers in Microbiology 3: 64 10.3389/fmicb.2012.00064</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.3389/fmicb.2012.00064</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3284728</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22375139</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Omoregie EO, Mastalerz V, de Lange G, Straub KL, Kappler A, et al. (2008) Biogeochemistry and Community Composition of Iron- and Sulfur-Precipitating Microbial Mats at the Chefren Mud Volcano (Nile Deep Sea Fan, Eastern Mediterranean). Proc Natl Acad Sci USA 74: 3198&#x20